l value. Then, we have the following information:\n\n- $\\text{new value}=2.8x$\n\n- $\\text{original value}=x$\n\nSubstituting these values into our formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{percentage change} & =\\frac{|2.8x-x|}{x}\\times 100% \\\\  & =\\frac{|1.8x|}{x}\\times 100% \\\\  & =\\frac{1.8x}{x}\\times 100% \\\\  & =\\frac{1.8\\cancel{x}}{\\cancel{x}}\\times 100% \\\\  & =1.8\\times 100% \\\\  & =180%.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the smaller number is increased by $180%.$" 13194139539471 17592186576411 false] [17592186617777 1074 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\text{percentage change}=\\frac{|\\text{new value}-\\text{original value}|}{\\text{original value}}\\times 100\\%.\n$$\n\nLet $x$ be the original value. Then, we have the following information:\n\n- $\\text{new value}=2.8x$\n\n- $\\text{original value}=x$\n\nSubstituting these values into our formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{percentage change} & =\\frac{|2.8x-x|}{x}\\times 100\\% \\\\  & =\\frac{|1.8x|}{x}\\times 100\\% \\\\  & =\\frac{1.8x}{x}\\times 100\\% \\\\  & =\\frac{1.8\\cancel{x}}{\\cancel{x}}\\times 100\\% \\\\  & =1.8\\times 100\\% \\\\  & =180\\%.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the smaller number is increased by $180\\%.$" 13194139539471 17592186576411 true] [17592186617778 1074 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\text{percentage change}=\\frac{|\\text{new value}-\\text{original value}|}{\\text{original value}}\\times 100%.\n$$\n\nWe have the following information:\n\n- $\\text{new value}=8,640$ views\n\n- $\\text{original value}=7,680$ views\n\nSubstituting these values into our formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{percentage change} & =\\frac{|8,640-7,680|}{7,680}\\times 100% \\\\  & =\\frac{|960|}{7,680}\\times 100% \\\\  & =\\frac{960}{7,680}\\times 100% \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}\\times 100% \\\\  & =0.125\\times 100% \\\\  & =12.5%.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the percentage increase is $12.5%.$" 13194139539471 17592186576411 false] [17592186617778 1074 "We